      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'll read both the original test and the CUT source to understand the context before improving understandability.Now I have a clear picture. The test has many unused data provider methods and imports that add noise. I'll create an improved version that:\n1. Removes unused imports and dead data provider methods\n2. Adds brief comments explaining the era conversion logic\n3. Keeps the actual test method unchangedThe improved test compiled successfully. The refactored version removes all unused imports and dead data provider methods, formats the `INSTANCE` builder across multiple lines for readability, and adds two brief comments explaining the CE/BCE-to-proleptic-year mapping — while keeping the test method and its assertions identical to the original."
    }
